me":"55 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796155200","title":"Carl Th. Dreyers sidste film","released":"2026-12-01T20:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-01T20:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-01T20:45:00Z","runtime":"45 min","description":"Dansk dokumentar fra 2022. Den blev beundret af fa og forkastet af mange. Carl Th. Dreyers sidste film \"Gertrud\" affodte allerede ved premieren i 1964 strke reaktioner verden over og blev kontroversielt modtaget. Produceret i Danmark og med en rkke populre skuespillere, formaede \"Gertrud\" alligevel at placere sig milevidt fra de folkekomedier og ugebladsfilmatiseringer, som ellers dominerede dansk film dengang. Dette er den fascinerende, og til tider tragiske historie, om tilblivelsen af et af filmhistoriens mest enestaende vrker."},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796157900","title":"Troldspejlet","released":"2026-12-01T20:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-01T20:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-01T21:00:00Z","runtime":"15 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796158800","title":"TVA","released":"2026-12-01T21:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-01T21:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-01T21:15:00Z","runtime":"15 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796159700","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-12-01T21:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-01T21:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-01T21:45:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796161500","title":"Brodrene Andersson","released":"2026-12-01T21:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-01T21:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-01T23:10:00Z","runtime":"85 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796166600","title":"Live Aid - Da rocken reddede verden","released":"2026-12-01T23:10:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-01T23:10:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-01T23:55:00Z","runtime":"45 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796169300","title":"Japans verdenskrig","released":"2026-12-01T23:55:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-01T23:55:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-02T00:45:00Z","runtime":"50 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796172300","title":"Julius Csar - En diktator fodes","released":"2026-12-02T00:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-02T00:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-02T01:40:00Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796175600","title":"Niels Bohr - danskeren der ndrede verden","released":"2026-12-02T01:40:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-02T01:40:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-02T02:20:00Z","runtime":"40 min","description":"I 1913 udviklede Niels Bohr sin geniale atommodel. Den star i dag som en af de mest banebrydende opdagelser i verdenshistorien. Hans atommodel er indirekte forudstningen for atombomben, men ogsa for de computere, lasere og mobiltelefoner, moderne mennesker er afhngige af i dag. Al informationsteknologi er saledes vokset ud af Bohrs opdagelse i 1913, og man anslar, at en tredjedel af verdensokonomien hviler pa kvantefysikken. Han var ikke kun en genial videnskabsmand, men ogsa en stor humanist, en renssancemand, en verdensborger, der omgik nogle af verdenshistoriens forende skikkelser. Niels Bo"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796178000","title":"Store danskere","released":"2026-12-02T02:20:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-02T02:20:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-02T03:00:00Z","runtime":"40 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796180400","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-12-02T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-02T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-02T03:30:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796182200","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-12-02T03:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-02T03:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-02T04:00:00Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796184000","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-12-02T04:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-12-02T04:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-02T04:25:00Z","runtime":"25 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_815a5f23c693245d492a6ea6_epg_1796185500","title":"Deadline","released":"2026-12-02T04:25:00Z","startTime":"20